{"name":"Thumb pulling","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":50,"casual":{"lead":["Thumb pulling means placing a thumb on the roof of the mouth and pulling down and forward, aiming for a wider palate, a more forward upper jaw, easier breathing and a fuller midface and smile. It is presented as a do-it-yourself imitation of orthodontic palate expanders.","The theory is that sustained force on the palate remodels bone, as expansion appliances do. Professional expansion uses fixed appliances applying controlled force over weeks, mostly in children and teens, because the midpalatal suture generally fuses after puberty. No published study has tested thumb pulling; some forum users report a sense of movement, others call it ineffective."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["Users usually do it in short daily sessions alongside mewing and chewing, and sometimes combine it with expanders. They commonly track changes by comparing smile and palate photos over months."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["No clinical safety data exist for thumb pulling. Orthodontic literature on appliance expansion lists a gap between the upper front teeth, pain and bone thinning, and forum posts describe a front-tooth gap after combining thumb pulling with hard mewing and expanders. Hygiene and gag-reflex discomfort are other practical issues."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[{"title":"Dispenser for confectionery products in semi-solid state","url":"https://europepmc.org/article/PAT/EP1206910","source":null,"year":2002,"cites":0,"kind":null}],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Thumbpulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling.1788934/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228021710/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling.1788934/"},{"title":"Thumbpulling harbi ise yariyomu yoksa benmi deluzyon goruyom","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-harbi-ise-yariyomu-yoksa-benmi-deluzyon-goruyom.1787487/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228025702/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-harbi-ise-yariyomu-yoksa-benmi-deluzyon-goruyom.1787487/"},{"title":"thumbpulling propaganda","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-propaganda.1777623/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251230135842/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-propaganda.1777623/"},{"title":"thumbpulling is working","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-is-working.1743610/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251219160253/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-is-working.1743610/"},{"title":"thumbpulling during puberty isnt cope","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-during-puberty-isnt-cope.1721585/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251219030128/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-during-puberty-isnt-cope.1721585/"},{"title":"thumbpulling for 2 years now","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-for-2-years-now.1645400/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260410171325/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-for-2-years-now.1645400/"},{"title":"thumbpulling guide what worked for me","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-guide-what-worked-for-me.1505811/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250719045811/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-guide-what-worked-for-me.1505811/"},{"title":"thumb pulling update","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-update.1474237/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250812125235/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-update.1474237/"},{"title":"thumbpulling and forward growth","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-and-forward-growth.1468493/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250714080753/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulli