:"https://t-nation.com/t/magicks-training-log-v2/226628","site":"T Nation · 2177 posts · 2017"},{"title":"thumbpulling underbite","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-underbite.1205380/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250523222331/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-underbite.1205380/"},{"title":"thumbpulling a list of copes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-a-list-of-copes.1163441/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240926140655/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-a-list-of-copes.1163441/"},{"title":"thumb pulling slight underbite","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-slight-underbite.1140845/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250523165031/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-slight-underbite.1140845/"},{"title":"thumb pulling and maxilla growth","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-and-maxilla-growth.938667/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240214041149/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-and-maxilla-growth.938667/"},{"title":"thumbpulling ruined my bite","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-ruined-my-bite.932504/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240317193221/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-ruined-my-bite.932504/"},{"title":"thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.590742/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221023124940/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.590742/"},{"title":"thumbpulling is legit for pubertycels","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-is-legit-for-pubertycels.590365/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221023115509/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-is-legit-for-pubertycels.590365/"},{"title":"does thumbpulling increase psl or appeal","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/does-thumbpulling-increase-psl-or-appeal.2025125/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260422155706/https://looksmax.org/threads/does-thumbpulling-increase-psl-or-appeal.2025125/"},{"title":"does this study prove thumbpulling works","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/does-this-study-prove-thumbpulling-works.1667465/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251202135435/https://looksmax.org/threads/does-this-study-prove-thumbpulling-works.1667465/"},{"title":"how i can fix this type of assymetry and is thumbpulling cope","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/how-i-can-fix-this-type-of-assymetry-and-is-thumbpulling-cope.1661068/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251215114909/https://looksmax.org/threads/how-i-can-fix-this-type-of-assymetry-and-is-thumbpulling-cope.1661068/"},{"title":"the holy grail thumbpulling bonesmashing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/the-holy-grail-thumbpulling-bonesmashing.1642102/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251121224634/https://looksmax.org/threads/the-holy-grail-thumbpulling-bonesmashing.1642102/"},{"title":"if dr mew looked into thumbpulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/if-dr-mew-looked-into-thumbpulling.1499618/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250815132229/https://looksmax.org/threads/if-dr-mew-looked-into-thumbpulling.1499618/"},{"title":"my normie friend asked me about thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/my-normie-friend-asked-me-about-thumb-pulling.1395637/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250522002229/https://looksmax.org/threads/my-normie-friend-asked-me-about-thumb-pulling.1395637/"},{"title":"does thumbpulling help me fix underbite","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/does-thumbpulling-help-me-fix-underbite.1389588/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250525052453/https://looksmax.org/threads/does-thumbpulling-help-me-fix-underbite.1389588/"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Hop-o'-My-Thumb — Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hop-o%27-My-Thumb"},{"title":"Palatal expansion (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatal_expansion"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Jawline & face shape","chain":["Thumb pulls palate downward","Claimed maxilla widening or advance","Fuller midface, wider smile"],"effect":"claimed","text":"Thumb pulling is used as a free stand-in for palatal expansion, aiming for a wider palate, more forward midface and fuller smile. It is usually paired with mewing and chewing; no study has tested it, whereas appliance-based expansion is an established orthodontic treatment."},"wikipedia":{"title":"Hop-o'-My-Thumb","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hop-o%27-My-Thumb"},"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Thumb pulling is a practice in looksmaxxing communities in which a person pulls on the palate with the thumb, usually downward and forward, in the belief that it can widen the palate or move the maxilla forward [1][2]. It is discussed as a free alternative to professional palatal expansion and is commonly paired with mewing and chewing.","No published study has tested thumb pulling. Professional palatal expansion, by contrast, is an established orthodontic procedure that uses appliances, usually in children and adolescents, because the midpalatal suture is open early in life and generally fuses after puberty [3]."],"infobox":[["Type","Manual palate-pulling practice"],["Also called","Thumbpulling, palate expansion by thumb"],["Compared to","Orthodontic palatal expansion (appliance-based)"],["Commonly paired with","Mewing, chewing, chin tucks"],["Evidence level","Unproven"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Forum threads describe placing a thumb against the palate and pulling, with questions about exactly where on the palate to place the thumb. Related threads discuss thumb pulling for underbites and maxilla growth, and whether a second person could do the pulling [4]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Comparison with orthodontic expansion","paras":["Rapid palatal expansion uses a device the patient turns to widen the palate roughly 0.5 to 1 mm per day, typically left in for three to six months, and is mostly done in children and adolescents aged about 8 to 18 [3]. In adults the suture generally requires surgery or implant assistance, and side effects include speech changes, pain, tongue sores and a gap between the upper front teeth [3]. Treatment after the growth spurt is described as mainly moving teeth rather than changing bone [3]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. No published trial or case series has tested thumb pulling. Research on palatal expansion concerns orthodontic appliances, not manual pulling [3]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["On looksmax.org, one user said that after being told the method was 'cope' with no results, he saw a change after a week of twice-daily thumb pulling with hard mewing, reporting a larger palate on one side and easier breathing [1]. Another asked whether it works and said they could breathe better after two weeks, while a reply said thumb pulling works in theory but that a thumb cannot generate enough force for long enough, calling it a diluted version of an expander [2]. A third thread's replies suggest it no longer works after about age 15 to 16, while a 17-year-old described feeling something in the maxilla [5]. Other threads report no progress after three months, a gap between the front teeth after expansion combined with thumb pulling, and straighter noses attributed to chewing and thumb pulling."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Thumb pulling is treated as a low-cost add-on to mewing, with members divided on whether it does anything [1][2][5].","claims":[{"claim":"Thumb pulling can widen the palate or advance the maxilla","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"It only works before about 15 or 16","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"A thumb cannot generate enough force to matter","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Thumb pulling can create a diastema or other tooth changes","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Thumb pulling update","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-update.1474237/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Thumb Pulling Works Or is it bs?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-works-or-is-it-bs.1410346/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Palatal expansion","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatal_expansion","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Thumb pulling and maxilla growth","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-and-maxilla-growth.938667/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.1230164/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"}],"studies":[{"title":"Palatal expansion","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatal_expansion","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Thumbpulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling.1788934/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228021710/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling.1788934/"},{"title":"Thumbpulling harbi ise yariyomu yoksa benmi deluzyon goruyom","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-harbi-ise-yariyomu-yoksa-benmi-deluzyon-goruyom.1787487/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228025702/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-harbi-ise-yariyomu-yoksa-benmi-deluzyon-goruyom.1787487/"},{"title":"thumbpulling propaganda","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-propaganda.1777623/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251230135842/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumbpulling-propaganda.1777623/"},{"title":"thumbpulling is